    <name>Mixed L03A - Tempo 3x10 @ 82% + Sprints</name>
    <description>Mixed - level 3 of 10, variant A. Tempo 3x10 @ 82% + Sprints.

Structure: 10 min warm-up, 9:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 4 min @ 55%, 9:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 4 min @ 55%, 9:50 @ 82%, 10 s @ 160%, 7 min @ 60%, 5 min cool-down.

Coach notes: Three 10-minute tempo blocks, each ending in a sprint. Shift up one gear before you go.

Estimated TSS: 52.</description>
